cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, please cite it and the method paper it implements."
title: "Swath Profile for ArcGIS Pro"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
type: software
license: GPL-3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/james-lagreca/swath-profile-arcgis-pro"
url: "https://github.com/james-lagreca/swath-profile-arcgis-pro"
authors:
  - family-names: LaGreca
    given-names: James
abstract: >-
  An ArcGIS Pro Python toolbox that extracts swath profiles along drawn or
  existing baselines, or along transects placed automatically across a fault
  trace: per-station minimum, maximum, mean, median, quartiles, percentiles,
  local relief, hypsometric integral and the terrain hypsometric index (THi),
  with an interactive chart linked to the map. A port of the SwathProfiler
  method of Perez-Pena et al. (2017) to arcpy/numpy, with documented fixes to
  seventeen numerical defects of the reference implementations.
keywords:
  - swath profile
  - geomorphology
  - tectonic geomorphology
  - ArcGIS Pro
  - hypsometric integral
references:
  - type: article
    title: "SwathProfiler and NProfiler: Two new ArcGIS Add-ins for the automatic extraction of swath and normalized river profiles"
    authors:
      - family-names: Pérez-Peña
        given-names: J. V.
      - family-names: Al-Awabdeh
        given-names: M.
      - family-names: Azañón
        given-names: J. M.
      - family-names: Galve
        given-names: J. P.
      - family-names: Booth-Rea
        given-names: G.
      - family-names: Notti
        given-names: D.
    journal: "Computers & Geosciences"
    volume: 104
    start: 135
    end: 150
    year: 2017
    doi: 10.1016/j.cageo.2016.08.008
